<title>FRANCE: Morgan starts Credit Local-Dexia coverage.</title>
<headline>Morgan starts Credit Local-Dexia coverage.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley has opened coverage of CLF Dexia-France with a &quot;strong buy&quot; recommendation, market sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>The U.S. brokerage has set a share price target of 650 francs for the bank group in France and 4,000 Belgian francs for Dexia in Belgium.</p>
<p>CLF Dexia-France eased 0.22 percent to 460 francs at 1504 GMT, while the market was down 1.4 percent</p>
<p>CLF Dexia-France was formed from the merger of Credit Local de France and Belgium's Credit Communal.</p>
</text>
